WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.958
Step 1: Ask a user manager to open your Personal settings and verify your phone number. Time &amp; Attendance shows the clock PIN from its unique last four digits.

2
00:00:09.958 --> 00:00:16.458
Step 2: Check that the shift is assigned, published, at this location and on the correct Melbourne day.

3
00:00:16.458 --> 00:00:23.292
Step 3: Use the action offered for the current work/break stage. Early starts require a different authorised manager’s approval.

4
00:00:23.292 --> 00:00:32.292
Step 4: After repeated wrong PINs, allow the limit to expire or ask a user manager to reset PIN access by saving the phone number again.
